@startuml states
!include style.iuml
[*] --> MainMenu
MainMenu --> Placement : Start Mission
Placement --> Playing : tap a plane\n(one anchored dome)
Playing --> GameOver : timer ends (Victory)\nor health hits 0 (Defeat)
GameOver --> Playing : Restart
GameOver --> MainMenu : Main Menu
MainMenu --> MainMenu : Leaderboard / Settings
state Playing {
  [*] --> Spawning
  Spawning --> Spawning : spawn every few seconds
}
note right of GameOver : enemies and bullets wiped,\nsession saved to leaderboard
@enduml
